Refund Policy

Last updated: 2026

ProfitFlowOS offers subscription-based access to the platform.

Monthly Plans

Monthly subscriptions may be canceled at any time. Access remains active until the end of the billing cycle.

Annual Plans

Annual plans are discounted and are generally non-refundable once access has been granted.

However, we may review refund requests on a case-by-case basis if requested within 7 days of purchase.

Cancellations

Users can cancel subscriptions through their account settings or via the Stripe billing portal.

After cancellation, the subscription will remain active until the end of the current billing period.

Contact

For refund requests or billing questions contact:

[support@profitflowos.com](mailto:support@profitflowos.com)
